Henry J Cobb wrote:
> The regen rate does seem to be less than usual.

Yep.  The old Eye's super-fast regen rate is gone.  A wizard with an
amulet of power will always have the fastest possible regen rate, but
it's a touch less ludicrous than it was.

> The big change I'd like to see is some way for a putz like me to make it
> as a rogue without wishing for Magicbane.

Many rogues have successfully ascended without Magicbane.

The thrown daggers are extremely good, even without taking the backstab
bonus into account.  The expert #twoweapon is also nice.  And the quest
artifact provides half physical damage and teleport control.

> Dip into Moorcock and give me a Shield of Chaos that provides magic and
> curse resistance.

This would be broken in a number of different ways, not the least of
which being how neatly it fits into a slot where there's currently no
competition at all.

> Or to be really evil let Stormbringer eat curses.  

This is less broken, but why be so focused on curse resistance?  Scrolls
of remove curse and holy water are rather plentiful; surely your items
getting cursed isn't the primary reason you're wishing for Magicbane?

